================================================================================
2026-08-06 — GitLab CI Phase 3: the nightly prod build and the site deploy
================================================================================

- (⭐ CPO INSTRUCTION: DO NOT RUN THE COST TOOLING) Recorded because `scope-auditor` FAILED the
