      Round 1 (season-level flags, all seasons not just current): the "ALL False" claim was
        wrong — 2023-2025 seasons show full True coverage for 5 of 6 leagues (not NWSL, which was
        always full); the flag is a season-eligibility declaration, not a per-match guarantee.
