  ⚠ RECORDED AS A REVERSAL, TAKEN KNOWINGLY. Nobody may later restore a delete as a regression fix.
  ⚠ The 5-fixture / 29-event backlog is still NOT repaired; those events are gone at source.
  ⛔ THAT LAST LINE WAS HALF WRONG AND 12 OF THE 29 EVENTS WERE RECOVERED HOURS LATER — see the
